// Article 5. Distributions.
#require "3-incapacity.charter".
Power pay-settlor Actor trustee Related to amount : USD
  Valid when !deceased(Margaret) && amount <= fund
  Creates fund(fund - amount)

Function share Identified by beneficiary * amount : USD
Extend Event death
  Creates share(Anna, MulDivRound(fund, 1, 2, Floor))
        , share(Ben, MulDivRound(fund, 1, 2, Floor))
        , fund($0)
    When settlor(person)

Input Fact reached-twenty-five Identified by beneficiary
Fact paid Identified by beneficiary * amount : USD
Power pay-share Actor trustee Recipient beneficiary
  Valid when reached-twenty-five(beneficiary)
  Creates (Foreach share: paid(beneficiary, share.amount) When share.beneficiary == beneficiary)
  Terminates (Foreach share: share When share.beneficiary == beneficiary)

Clause 5.1 => pay-settlor
Clause 5.2 Definition => share
Clause 5.3 => reached-twenty-five, pay-share, paid.
